  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Tech Stack: React Native (Expo) - Mobile App. MUST USE .js files instead of .tsx for React components.",
    "Icons: Use lucide-react-native. Do not use standard emoji icons.",
    "Interaction: Heavy use of horizontal slides. Use standard React Native ScrollView with pagingEnabled={true} for carousels (Onboarding, Pipeline stages).",
    "Authentication: JWT custom auth with slide transitions between Login and Register.",
    "Dashboard: Implement a bento-grid style structure using native Flexbox. Use solid flat surfaces with 1px border. No heavy drop-shadows.",
    "Kanban / Pipeline: Should be horizontally swipeable stages. Each stage is a vertical ScrollView of deal cards.",
    "Testing: Critical - All interactive and key informational elements MUST include a data-testid attribute to facilitate automated testing.",
    "Do not use generic UI libraries that bloat the app. Build custom high-contrast UI components using React Native StyleSheet."
  ]
}